#. settings-schema.json->hotkeys-legend->description
msgid ""
"Escape:\t\t\tHide greenTile\n"
"Enter or Space:\tCommit current selection\n"
"Left:\t\t\tMove Left inside Grid\n"
"Right:\t\t\tMove Right inside Grid\n"
"Up:\t\t\t\tMove Up inside Grid\n"
"Down:\t\t\tMove Down inside Grid\n"
"<Shift>Left:\t\tInclude column to the Left in selection\n"
"<Shift>Right:\t\tInclude column to the Right in selection\n"
"<Shift>Up:\t\tInclude row Above in selection\n"
"<Shift>Down:\tInclude row Below in selection\n"
"<Alt>Left:\t\tMove to the monitor on the Left\n"
"<Alt>Right:\t\tMove to the monitor on the Right\n"
"<Alt>Up:\t\t\tMove to the monitor Above\n"
"<Alt>Down:\t\tMove to the monitor Below\n"
"1:\t\t\t\tSelect the first grid layout\n"
"2:\t\t\t\tSelect the second grid layout\n"
"3:\t\t\t\tSelect the third grid layout\n"
"4:\t\t\t\tSelect the fourth grid layout"
msgstr ""
"Escape:\t\t\tgreenTile ausblenden\n"
"Enter/Leertaste:\tAuswahl übernehmen\n"
"Left:\t\t\tIm Raster nach links\n"
"Right:\t\t\tIm Raster nach rechts\n"
"Up:\t\t\t\tIm Raster nach oben\n"
"Down:\t\t\tIm Raster nach unten\n"
"<Shift>Left:\t\tSpalte links zur Auswahl hinzufügen\n"
"<Shift>Right:\t\tSpalte rechts zur Auswahl hinzufügen\n"
"<Shift>Up:\t\tZeile darüber zur Auswahl hinzufügen\n"
"<Shift>Down:\tZeile darunter zur Auswahl hinzufügen\n"
"<Alt>Left:\t\tZum Monitor links wechseln\n"
"<Alt>Right:\t\tZum Monitor rechts wechseln\n"
"<Alt>Up:\t\t\tZum Monitor darüber wechseln\n"
"<Alt>Down:\t\tZum Monitor darunter wechseln\n"
"1:\t\t\t\tErstes Raster-Layout wählen\n"
"2:\t\t\t\tZweites Raster-Layout wählen\n"
"3:\t\t\t\tDrittes Raster-Layout wählen\n"
"4:\t\t\t\tViertes Raster-Layout wählen"

#. settings-schema.json->hotkey->description
msgid "Global Hotkey for greenTile"
msgstr "Globales Tastenkürzel für greenTile"

#. settings-schema.json->autotile6hotkey->description
msgid "Tile all windows into 6 columns"
msgstr "Alle Fenster in 6 Spalten kacheln"

#. settings-schema.json->autotile3hotkey->description
msgid "Tile all windows into 3 columns"
msgstr "Alle Fenster in 3 Spalten kacheln"

#. settings-schema.json->autotileautohotkey->description
msgid "Turn automatic tiling on for this workspace and tile now"
msgstr "Automatisches Kacheln für diese Arbeitsfläche einschalten und sofort kacheln"

#. settings-schema.json->autotileoffhotkey->description
msgid "Turn automatic tiling off for this workspace"
msgstr "Automatisches Kacheln für diese Arbeitsfläche ausschalten"

#. settings-schema.json->presetHotkey->description
msgid "Open the preset panel"
msgstr "Preset-Panel öffnen"

#. settings-schema.json->presets->description
msgid "Preset definitions (JSON)"
msgstr "Preset-Definitionen (JSON)"

#. settings-schema.json->wsPresets->description
msgid "Workspace to preset assignments (JSON)"
msgstr "Zuordnung von Arbeitsflächen zu Presets (JSON)"

#. settings-schema.json->general->description
msgid "General settings (JSON), e.g. automatic tiling per workspace"
msgstr "Allgemeine Einstellungen (JSON), z. B. automatisches Kacheln pro Arbeitsfläche"

#. settings-schema.json->animation->description
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animation"

#. settings-schema.json->autoclose->description
msgid "Auto-Close"
msgstr "Automatisch schließen"

#. settings-schema.json->aspect-ratio->description
msgid "Use monitor aspect ratio"
msgstr "Seitenverhältnis des Monitors verwenden"

#. settings-schema.json->aspect-ratio->tooltip
msgid ""
"Should the popup's grid reflect the current monitor's aspect ratio or not."
msgstr ""
"Legt fest, ob das Raster im Popup dem Seitenverhältnis des aktuellen "
"Monitors folgt."

#. settings-schema.json->useMonitorCenter->description
msgid "UI always centered to monitor"
msgstr "Oberfläche immer mittig auf dem Monitor"

#. settings-schema.json->useMonitorCenter->tooltip
msgid ""
"By default the grid UI shows up in the middle of the active window. With "
"this, it always displays in the middle of the monitor."
msgstr ""
"Standardmäßig erscheint das Raster in der Mitte des aktiven Fensters. Mit "
"dieser Option erscheint es immer in der Mitte des Monitors."

#. settings-schema.json->showGridOnAllMonitors->description
msgid "Show UI and all monitors at the same time"
msgstr "Oberfläche auf allen Monitoren gleichzeitig anzeigen"

#. settings-schema.json->columns->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid1x->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid2x->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid3x->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid4x->description
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "Spalten"

#. settings-schema.json->rows->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid1y->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid2y->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid3y->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid4y->description
msgid "Rows"
msgstr "Zeilen"

#. settings-schema.json->grid1NameOverride->description
msgid "Name Override on the UI"
msgstr "Eigener Name in der Oberfläche"

#. settings-schema.json->grid1x->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid2x->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid3x->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid4x->tooltip
msgid ""
"Each row represents a column. Span is how much space a column should take up "
"compared to the other columns. Default is 1."
msgstr ""
"Jeder Eintrag steht für eine Spalte. „Anteil“ gibt an, wie viel Platz die "
"Spalte im Verhältnis zu den anderen einnimmt. Standard ist 1."

#. settings-schema.json->grid1x->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid1y->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid2x->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid2y->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid3x->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid3y->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid4x->columns->title
#. settings-schema.json->grid4y->columns->title
msgid "Span"
msgstr "Anteil"

#. settings-schema.json->grid1y->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid2y->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid3y->tooltip
#. settings-schema.json->grid4y->tooltip
msgid ""
"Each row represents a row. Span is how much space a row should take up "
"compared to the other columns. Default is 1."
msgstr ""
"Jeder Eintrag steht für eine Rasterzeile. „Anteil“ gibt an, wie viel Platz "
"die Zeile im Verhältnis zu den anderen einnimmt. Standard ist 1."

#. settings-schema.json->grid2NameOverride->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid3NameOverride->description
#. settings-schema.json->grid4NameOverride->description
msgid "Name Override"
msgstr "Eigener Name"

#. settings-schema.json->select-using-keyboard->description
msgid "Show tile labels"
msgstr "Kachel-Beschriftungen anzeigen"

